[Invariant Violation] (sim-confirmed): User-declared invariant 'cumulative payouts must never exceed the contract's real native balance (payouts are funded only by ticket revenue still held)' is violated on 0x1fd07693355ac7f1c29d2fc2bbc390fc0d5ad2ee: lhs=1300000000000000300 Le rhs=0 does not hold (caller 0xff0f52636c2b4689179c1a99e45886b6eabdf967). This is a directly observed post-transaction state, not an inference.

[Zero Address Setter] (sim-review): 0x1fd07693355ac7f1c29d2fc2bbc390fc0d5ad2ee wrote address(0) into storage slot 2 at pc 962, overwriting a previously-set address value with no visible zero-check. If this slot holds an owner/admin/implementation role, the privileged address is now permanently the burn address -- a missing `require(newAddr != address(0))` guard (SWC-131, presence of unused variables / zero-address assignment).

